# --- Terraform ---
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log

# tfvarsは実値が入るため除外。サンプルファイルのみ許可する
**/terraform.tfvars
**/*.auto.tfvars
!**/terraform.tfvars.example

# --- Secrets / credentials 全般 ---
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.*
**/secrets/
**/credentials.json
**/service-account*.json

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/

# --- OS / editor ---
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
.claude/
